  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nephi1 is commanded to build ship, 1 Ne. 17:8, 49–51. elder brothers murmur at building of ship, 1 Ne. 17:17. the Lord shows Nephi1 how to build ship, 1 Ne. 18:1–3. Nephi1 finishes building ship, 1 Ne. 18:4. people of Lehi1 enter ship and sail to promised land, 1 Ne. 18:6–8. Hagoth builds large ship for voyages northward, Alma 63:5. other ships are built, Alma 63:7. ships are never heard of again, Alma 63:8. much timber sent to land northward by shipping, Hel. 3:10. record does not include full account of shipping and building of ships, Hel. 3:14.",
